{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2020-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1597536000, "end_date": 1598227199, "month_true_total": 1143, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:21:34 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "74807242", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970469317", "personaname": "Machinist", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970469317/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 675, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 363, "last_played": 1644816208, "avatar": "b3a1d41e879a69b11fed7a64a895b4ad3d9b44cd"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm giving the game a thumbs up ONLY because I can't give it a neutral rating.\n\nI'm sorry to say, but the game is boring.  Even with a full party it's just a drag to play.  I can't find any story that makes me want to come back and play it.  The game is well executed from a technical stand point and the developers are engaged with the community.  No show stopping bugs that have popped up.  I know I only have 6 hours in the game, but after that duration if the game hasn't grabbed my attention, I can't see that it will change in the future.", "timestamp_created": 1598224366, "timestamp_updated": 1598224366, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "74807224", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072621598", "personaname": "barf boy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072621598/", "num_games_owned": 424, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 16985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2003, "last_played": 176327